keywords: "circle progression, descending fifths sequence, circle of fifths chord progression, circle progression in major, circle progression in minor"
categories: "Harmony, Chord Progressions"
tags: "sequence, chord progression, circle of fifths, major, minor"
date: 2026-08-01
intro: "The circle progression moves through a chain of descending fifths and returns to the tonic. Its major and minor forms use almost the same chords, but their starting point, ending, and dominant establish different tonal centers."
reader_level: arranger
