keywords: "how to build chord progressions, create a chord progression, harmonic rhythm, chord functions, voice leading, songwriting harmony"
categories: "Harmony, Chord progressions"
tags: "chord progressions, harmony, chord functions, voice leading, harmonic rhythm"
date: 2026-07-28
intro: "A strong chord progression is not a random string of chords. It is a route through stability, motion, tension, and release."
reader_level: arranger
